00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:00.810
Byako...

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.410
That's your cat?

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.570
Thank goodness, you are alive.

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:07.680
She forgot about him.

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:14.240
I feel alive again.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.820
You guys saved my life, Momoko, Inuzuka.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.140
You are welcome.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.270
By the way, why are you here?

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.220
About that...

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.980
It's a long story...

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.680
Why do I have a very bad feeling about this?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.160
Listen carefully, Inuzuka.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.170
I don't wanna, I don't wanna!

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:32.890
Listen!

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.750
They are dangerous martial artists, this is about your life!

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:37.920
That just makes it worse!

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.110
Uh... What's going on?

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:45.360
Clash! Tiger Brothers

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.120
Koganei five brothers?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:47.930
Yeah.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.030
Including me, there are five brothers.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:51.230
My little brother.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.480
My younger big brother.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:53.650
My big sister.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.620
And my older big brother.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:57.980
They...

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.300
...want to kill Inuzuka.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.440
More assassins, right?

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.170
Your brothers, huh?

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.940
Can I beat them with plastic bottles?

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.830
Idiot! Don't underestimate them! You'll die!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.970
They are dangerous!

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:17.880
I got what you are saying.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.770
But you were an assassin!

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.570
You once wanted to kill me.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.790
Why are you helping me this time?

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.150
Well... It's that...

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.760
You are my comrade.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:31.480
Huh?

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.550
It's true that we were once enemies.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.700
But we love the same woman, and we fought with love at stake.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:42.120
When a comrade from the battlefield of love is in danger...

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.200
I just couldn't keep myself quiet about it!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.010
It's gonna be alright.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:50.630
As long as I'm here, no matter what dirty tricks my brothers use...

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.060
Comrade? What a load of bullshit.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:56.190
Right?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.280
Comrades from the battlefield of love...

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.420
So this is the friendship between men!

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.120
In that case...

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:12.350
Drink all you can tonight!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.050
Wait a minute, we are minors!

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.820
Rest assured, this is orange juice.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.610
I thought it's nice to have the atmosphere.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.900
Alright! Let's drink!

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.730
Take your time.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.110
Okay.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.640
She's so cute...

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.090
Momoko is so cute...

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.410
This guy is so into it.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:48.240
Do you see her like this everyday?

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.590
I envy you...

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.670
I hate you after all.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.870
What's so great about it?

00:04:55.990 --> 00:05:00.830
Ever since she became my fiancée, I've seen nothing but assassins.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.560
It's a pain in the ass.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.420
So that's what you think of Momoko?

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.240
You are strange.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.060
I wouldn't expect you to understand.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.710
I have nothing to do with martial artists, yet I got involved in this.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.950
I don't get you at all.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:20.890
What did you say?

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:26.890
People want to kill you, how can you say you have nothing to do with them?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.160
Yet you are saying you don't want to learn martial arts.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.920
Why not? Just do it.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:35.520
"Why"...?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.200
It's all clear to me again.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.590
I love Momoko after all.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.790
But she's his woman now.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.360
I lost to Inuzuka once.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.280
But I'm sure one of these days...

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:54.670
I'll become a man who Momoko will look back at.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.720
Until then...

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.660
Koushi-dono, excuse me.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.490
Koushi-dono, please be gentle to me.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.180
Koushi-dono, you are using that approach tonight...

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.170
No... You are even using tools...

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:30.090
Tools!?

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.070
You are so cruel...

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.070
Sign: No entering. Bubble: Tools.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:36.020
I'll never forgive him!

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.020
Hey, why are you following us?

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.220
I want to see what Momoko's school is like.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.420
Good morning!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.430
You are one of the Koganeis...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.350
So you are after Koushi senpai again...

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:53.760
Wait a second.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.020
Tenka-dono is not an enemy anymore.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.350
He's our friend now.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.170
Huh?

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:06.040
Morning...

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:08.800
That person...

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:13.130
The Koganei brothers are after Koushi senpai?

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:14.390
Yeah.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.780
But I'll lend a hand too when the time comes.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.230
I was prepared for that when I left home.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.920
Really?

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:23.590
I guess...

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:28.170
I hope you are not trying to fool us.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.770
Of course not!

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.940
I'm not that despicable.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.580
That's amazing!

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:35.990
He's really good.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.330
Hey, you like soccer?

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:43.590
Yeah, I do.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:46.790
My big brother taught me soccer, after all.

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:49.800
Ah. Big brother!

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:52.250
Eh?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.900
Is that the youngest of the Koganei brothers?

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.130
Ah. My bad.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.290
I got the wrong person.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.120
He looks just like my big brother.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.660
He really scared me.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:10.080
A normal boy like that couldn't be an assassin.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.820
You can't enter our school if there is no emergency.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.010
Got it!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.600
You don't have to be so afraid.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:23.460
I'm here just to take a look, nothing important.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.840
Hey, Tenka, you can't come inside.

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:27.570
Okay.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:28.920
I'll wait over here.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.280
You are pathetic.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.940
You betrayed us after running away.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:34.890
You are wrong.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:35.890
At what?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.790
You are trembling, big brother.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:55.230
What's with that delinquent look?

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.530
I don't see how he has changed since then.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.210
There is nothing I can do...

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:05.310
There is nothing I can do...

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:07.790
Right?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:08.700
You are right.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.500
I'm sure Becky would understand.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.920
I didn't come to help Inuzuka.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.770
That's not what he said earlier...

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.970
My big brothers, big sister, and little brother...

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:21.790
They all pick on me because I'm the weakest...

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.520
Things just got worse after I failed the mission...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.380
Now that I'm found...

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.840
After I've finally found a place to stay after lying to Inuzuka and Momoko...

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.570
What did you say?

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.180
You are...!?

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:42.610
So you are hiding behind Inuzuka-kun, because you care more about own safety?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:45.810
Wait!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.760
Don't tell Inuzuka and Momoko.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.340
Besides, it's none of your business.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.090
Keep your month shut.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.790
I won't put Inuzuka-kun in danger for your vanity.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:56.860
No matter what.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:58.340
You...

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:00.530
...love him?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.890
Then please understand!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.650
I love Momoko.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.880
I don't want to embarrass myself in front of her.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.240
Though it's just vanity, I don't want her to hate me.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:11.430
You understand, don't you?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.380
You don't want to embarrass yourself? You don't want her to hate you?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.420
You are childish.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.120
You are too selfish for someone who's in love.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.440
What did you say?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:25.810
But aren't you suppose to stop your brothers without running away from home?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:29.200
If you really value Momoko-chan more than yourself, that is.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:36.360
If you can make a loved one happy by enduring...

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:45.050
Think about what you should and should not do, not for you, but for your loved one!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.360
Tenka-dono was not at the school gate.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.220
I guess he went home.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.380
It's hard, but I'll tell them everything.

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.170
About the fact that I ran away from home.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:10:59.310
He's suspicious after all.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.660
I'm sure he's still after onii-chan.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.110
When the time comes...

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.430
You know what to do.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:04.930
Yes.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.280
I've been waiting for you, onii-chan.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.790
Eh? Me?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.770
In that case, let's play.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.120
Tenka-dono!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.120
Tenka!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.100
This is nothing.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:45.960
Why did you interrupt us?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.350
You are a real pain in the ass, big brother.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:50.510
"Big brother"?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.330
Yeah.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:56.260
He fooled you earlier, but he's actually my little brother, Koganei Tenchi.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.980
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Koganei Tenchi

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.610
An assassin who's here to kill you.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:11:59.740
What?

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:03.450
Then let's protect Koushi-dono with all our strength!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.800
We'll help too.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:05.330
Okay!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.370
When did you guys...?

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.410
Wait.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.480
Leave this to me.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:11.890
But Tenka-dono...

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:12.680
Please!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.600
I have to face him no matter what.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.140
As his real brother.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.650
What do you mean?

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.950
Our other siblings were adopted.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.240
The Koganei clan only values strength.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.130
If you have strength, you can move into the head family even if you were born in the branch families.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.270
On the contrary, if you are weak, you will get demoted even if you are the oldest son of the head family.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:36.270
I was getting frustrated that my step brother will become the heir.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.530
At that time, I overheard my father talking about the assassination of Inuzuka Koushi.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:45.610
I took on the mission by myself, and saw it as a great chance to redeem my honor.

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:50.200
Tenchi cheered me on as my only ally.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.060
But I failed the mission.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:58.830
When I returned home, he lost all hopes on me.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.100
Leave the small talk.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.610
I'll finish you off first.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.120
Tenchi.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.530
Let's settle this with gladiator soccer.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.770
That's a great idea.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.400
What's gladiator soccer?

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:18.920
It's a legendary sport from the Koganei clan.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:23.820
But the ball in this game is the body of your opponent.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:28.090
It doesn't matter if you kick, hit, or even use weapons.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:31.040
You win as long as your opponent's body crosses the goal line.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:35.750
I've heard that it was banned due to its cruelty.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.820
Becky, I'll do my best.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.270
Cheer for me.

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:49.380
Soccer, huh?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.420
I taught you that a long time ago.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.150
A long time ago.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.600
Don't underestimate your big brother!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.700
I can win.

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.400
Tenchi may be strong.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:03.290
But I have an advantage on power because of his body size.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.670
He is mine once I corner him.

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:06.870
Here I come!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.880
This duel sure is surprisingly peaceful.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.730
Amazing! It's amazing!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:18.550
Huh?

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.210
Five hits on the face!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.650
A martial artist's vision

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.650
He dodged the tackle!

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:23.100
He's throwing consecutive punches!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.330
Tenchi is an amazing martial artist!

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.360
Eh?

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.070
A normal person's vision

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.110
Eight hits on the side!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.090
I can sense the pain from their battle aura!

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.560
Stop it!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:38.070
Brothers shouldn't fight a tragic battle like this!

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.930
Seven hits in the face!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:42.030
Nine hits in the stomach!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.130
What's happening this time?

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:53.930
Heh!?

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:55.280
It turned flat!?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.140
Spin ball chainsaw slash!

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.880
WHY!?

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.420
HOW!?

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:11.920
He spun the ball to an incredible speed, and used the centrifugal force to turn the ball into a pancake shape.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.460
My common sense is crumbling!

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.250
It's not over yet.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.950
Even if it's a corpse.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.270
Until I score a goal!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:28.750
Stop it already!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.660
Bye bye, big brother.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.520
Tenka!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.230
I quit.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.460
Hey bro, wake up.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.440
I found out already!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:45.570
Hey everyone.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.180
This guy is pretending to lose.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.060
He's pretending to lose?

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.200
"I can't win."

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.890
"I've had enough."

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.780
"But giving up would look uncool."

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.980
"I'll just lose on purpose.", right?

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.930
He's just this kind of person.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:03.720
He puts himself before everything.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:08.120
He easily gives up just to pretend to be cool or to protect himself.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.920
A long time ago, there were two brothers who really got along.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.180
The older brother taught the younger one soccer and martial arts.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:18.190
He was a wonderful big brother.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.900
While he was stronger than his younger brother, that is.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.880
The older brother felt threatened by his younger brother's growth.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.060
If his younger brother, who's the only person he can act cool in front, becomes stronger...

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.010
He will lose his place in the family.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.240
He gradually stopped talking to the younger brother.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:37.910
While I was learning martial arts...

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.770
Am I right!?

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:49.120
Don't you feel ashamed to lose to your little brother, then run away from him!?

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:52.100
Shit...

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.140
This is the worst...

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:56.000
On top of everything, Momoko is watching...

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.700
Crawl through the goal line!

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:01.770
While saying "please forgive me".

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.320
Then I'll let this end!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:13.640
Becky...

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:17.060
You are the only one who understands me, right?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.290
That again?

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:19.260
Becky...

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.680
It's over for me.

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.060
I'm sure Momoko despise me now.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:29.150
Though I've never expected her to love me.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.430
There is no reason to put effort into anything now, Becky.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.920
Becky will comfort me, right?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.340
You sure are a selfish man.

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:47.610
Give up just because she won't love you?

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.430
You are childish.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:51.440
You are too selfish for someone who's in love.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:52.410
What did you say?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.890
Even you are lecturing me like that?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.910
Not for your own sake, but for the person you love.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.110
These words...

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.630
But she's another man's woman, whether she dies or disappears is none of your business, right?

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.640
You are wrong, you are wrong, you are wrong!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:10.120
Momoko may not be my woman.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:11.690
But...

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.540
Even so...

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.240
I love...

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.530
...Momoko!

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.510
I want to protect her!

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:27.480
Tenchi, I won't lose to you this time no matter what.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.650
I'll have to use my ultimate technique!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.570
Ultimate technique?

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.390
Yeah right.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:34.640
Inuzuka.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:38.310
Don't laugh at me if you think that move looks embarrassing.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.660
"That move"?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.510
Don't tell me...

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.080
Don't tell me...

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.250
Cattail!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.410
Idiot! He's a big idiot!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.950
Are you stupid?

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:57.400
I'm not like you.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.480
My idiotic big brother is one thing.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.960
Me, the most talented genius in Koganei clan history.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.220
There is no way...

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.670
...that'll work.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:09.370
It's working!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.260
Those born in the head family of the Koganei clan have exceptional potential in martial arts.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.330
But they also share the common weakness of being cat-like.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:20.350
I overcame the weakness through rigorous training after I lost to Inuzuka.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.920
Now I can beat you.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:29.300
Running away was not the only thing I did.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.120
I was also training.

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:34.950
Shindara Rettetsu style ultimate technique!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.560
Overhead tiger shot!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:47.350
You did it!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.210
You did it, Koganei Tenka!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.370
Tenka-dono!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.830
I can't lose to you...

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:58.880
To a coward who couldn't even look me straight in the eye...

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.990
I'm sorry...

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.780
...for being a useless big brother.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.440
Feeling satisfied just for winning your little brother...

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.720
I can't think of you as my big brother.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.830
I'll defeat our older brothers too.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:25.560
I'll become a big brother you can feel proud of.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.200
So is this over for now?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.770
I wonder.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.400
But...

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.600
All I have to do now is to become stronger.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:37.210
I'm sure he'll be glad too.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:38.720
That must be hard on you.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.410
I got no choice.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:43.110
I was born as a Koganei.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.120
You can call this destiny.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.720
Destiny, huh?

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.920
But there are more, right?

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.110
Your siblings.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:50.990
Yeah.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.470
The others are even stronger than Tenchi.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.480
Stronger than him...?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.210
That's not the only problem!

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:59.060
I'm sure the others want to kill Koushi-kun!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.200
What are you so nervous about!?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.460
That's right, there is nothing to be afraid of.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.350
We have five of the strongest members!

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:09.360
You are right!

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:11.240
Just like Momoko senpai said.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.820
Miyamoto Iroha will risk her life to fight for senpai.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.430
Five? So I'm included?

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:21.600
Iroha-dono is so generous.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.650
She treated us dinner after Tenka-dono's fight.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:27.100
It's a token of friendship, eat up.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.080
Is this the treat?

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:32.090
However, are there more assassins?

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.040
I just want to live in peace.

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.060
My house!

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:48.730
Why!?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
May tonight be...

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
今夜もしかして

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
konya moshikashite

